  "resolvedReviewFindings": [
    "Independent contacts exposed an insufficient high-speed GP AI preview; fixed with bounded stopping-distance lookahead while preserving crash thresholds and non-GP targets.",
    "The enlarged GP feedback font initially exceeded the existing compact 1.35-scale layout gate; tightened spacing and kept the original gate unchanged.",
    "Recovery feedback was hidden by the off-route corner-guide return; added neutral BIKE CONTROL feedback outside the route while retaining marshal priority.",
    "Live wet review showed car-scale spray obscuring the rider; added an emitter-owned GP optical profile with unchanged particle work.",
    "Live cockpit review showed dashboard displacement through the screen; confirmed and corrected in a controlled thin-wall optical comparison.",
    "The wet pause assertion initially sampled before render interpolation reached the worker-acknowledged final frame. The test now waits for that presented timestamp and then proves unchanged particles across additional actual rendered frames.",
    "The independent fingerprint checker originally sorted Python Path components rather than the full strings sorted by Vite, producing a false mismatch. The final exact-algorithm comparison and all retained application diagnostics match the build fingerprint."
  ],
  "limits": [
    "Original procedural racing game with a reduced motorcycle solver; no claimed parity with the commercial photo references.",
    "Photographs constrain visible design cues, not numerical physics coefficients.",
    "Browser evidence uses a software GPU and establishes function, deterministic presentation and bounded fixture resources, not physical-device frame rates.",
    "The control-advice image uses explicit synthetic telemetry. Live clear/rain/replay images come from the real application at documented settings."
  ],
